00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.040
Central Florida at the University of Central&nbsp;
Florida. Mostly due to the Blair Witch Project&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.020
the success of that coming out of there that was&nbsp;
a really inspirational movie for me and there you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:23.220
had to go through a two-year program to be able&nbsp;
to be accepted into the film school and so I had a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.900
bunch of friends I was in a film club I was doing&nbsp;
a bunch of shorts and things with them and then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.840
we all submitted I was the weird genre kid I&nbsp;
was the one that wanted to make horror movies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:40.740
and action movies and comedy and everyone&nbsp;
else was kind of the artist filmmaker so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:46.680
all of my friends ended up getting in&nbsp;
but me because I was the weirdo so it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:53.400
that was disappointing of course because you spent&nbsp;
two years trying to to get into a program but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.400
what I did was I ended up leaving school at&nbsp;
that point moved over to Valencia College and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:03.240
finished up my a degree and then spent the&nbsp;
rest of my college fund on my first feature&nbsp;&nbsp;

