with friends in the woods with a camera like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:13.140
everybody starts with and then ended up signing&nbsp;
a really decent distribution deal on that so by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:17.700
the time the movie was already on store shelves&nbsp;
my friends were graduating so kind of kicked it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:24.060
off that way and of those friends that graduated&nbsp;
how many actually work in the film industry now&nbsp;&nbsp;

